      "writtenOn": "2018-03-22T03:41:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done\n\nI can look at the assembly, but I would be much more confident if we had a way of measuring the execution times of the code paths in a less error prone way than manual inspection.\n\nI wrote a test that tries to measure the runtime difference between successes and failures, but there is too much noise on the host for the test results to be meaningful. I may try putting the tests into a cr50 dev\u003d1 only console command.\n\nWe don\u0027t have to worry about caching because there is no DRAM so there is no caching of pages into SRAM unless you count flash.",
